Begin3
Title:          jSH
Version:        0.99
Entered-date:   2025-12-14
Description:    A Javascript scripting engine for DOS
Summary:        jSH is a script interpreter for DOS based operating systems like MS-DOS, FreeDOS or any DOS based Windows (like 95, 98, ME). The focus is on file io and text mode user interfaces. jSH is a side project to DOjS, a Javascript canvas for creative coding.
Keywords:       java, JavaScript
Author:         SuperIlu
Maintained-by:  SuperIlu
Primary-site:   https://github.com/SuperIlu/jSH
Original-site:  https://github.com/SuperIlu/jSH
Platforms:      DOS
Copying-policy: Various Licenses, See LICENSE file
